{
  "name": "neo-smallcaps",
  "version": 1,
  "source_charset": "neo-us.txt",
  "description": "Private glyph encoding: table-free Regular from lowercase source bits; Italic = Regular XOR 2B; Bold = Regular XOR 40; digits 30–39. Byte strings are hexadecimal.",
  "source_policy": "Regular is reassigned by a reversible bit transform. Incoming converters accept native lowercase letters; decode returns native lowercase or digits. Preserve original file bytes for exact case recovery. N-acute is omitted because Neo-US lacks its lowercase counterpart.",
  "artwork_policy": "Prefer same-family Adobe capitals at body x-height or one pixel taller; no whole-glyph rescaling.",
